  "readme": {
   "path": "README.md",
   "content": "# DigestIT\n\nAI generates changes faster than people can read them. DigestIT tracks project\ndiffs and explains each change at multiple levels of abstraction — from a\none-line business summary down to line-by-line code detail — on a timeline\ndashboard, so humans can keep up with AI-driven work.\n\n## License\n\nDigestIT is source-available under the [Business Source License 1.1](LICENSE).\n\n- **Free** for individuals and for organizations using it internally, including in production.\n- **Not permitted:** offering DigestIT, or a substantially similar derivative, to third parties as a competing hosted/managed/SaaS service.\n- **Each version converts to Apache 2.0** four years after its release (first Change Date: 2030-09-24).\n\nFor other licensing arrangements, open an issue on this repository.\n",
   "truncated": false
  },
